      "events": 1430,
      "chars": 185681,
      "cutMarker": "Must be soon, right? Now would be a nice time to evolve. Maybe it's level 60. I don't know. I forgot. I used to remember all these numbers, every level, every move to use. As proof of your victory, I conferred on you this. The official Pokemon League... Boulder badge. Oh my god, yes. Scott received the boulder badge from Brock. Our first gym badge, guys. Good job. We did it. Well done, guys. It was Art Mankey. It also enables the use of the move Flash outside of battle. Of course, a Pokemon must know the move Flash to use it. Thank you very much."
